Changes in protected-repair.js:
- Merge only the decode dependency closure into one private ES module.
- Fix GF(256) to 0x11d, primitive element 2, generator base 0 and 16 parity bytes.
- Remove encoding, generic field selection and unused polynomial methods.
- Use Uint8Array arithmetic buffers and views for leading-zero removal.
- Store logarithms at value minus one; field tables each contain 255 entries.
- Bound array lengths, Euclidean/division iterations and correction count.
- Reject locations outside the shortened codeword and nonzero residual syndromes.
- Preserve the input; return a data-only copy with 16 parity bytes removed.

The accompanying LICENSE is the full unmodified historical upstream license,
including its third-party jai-imageio notice. No jai-imageio code is included
in this decode-only port.
